Package: mcprobe
Title: ModelsCloud Executor Diagnostics (Temporary)
Version: 0.1.4
Authors@R: person("Ramin", "Rezaeianzadeh", email = "raminrzn@student.ubc.ca",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Temporary diagnostics for the UBC ModelsCloud executor: R
    version, operating system, CPU and memory limits, installed packages,
    network access to package repositories, request size and run time
    limits, whether INLA and JAGS can be installed and run, and whether the
    DYNAMO-HIA engine runs (hiaR tutorial). Written to
    plan a remote version of the voi package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports: curl, jsonlite, parallel, remotes, stats, utils, withr, fs
URL: https://github.com/raminrzn/mcprobe
